# Line endings are normalised to LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every file
# to CRLF, and the billing SQL suites break: they assert on migration text
# character by character (`proof.indexOf("select\n    count(*)")`) and one of
# them regex-matches another test file for `;\n\nlet db:`. Seventeen tests fail
# for a whitespace difference that never reaches the repository — git stores LF
# either way — which costs an afternoon to diagnose every time somebody clones
# on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git must never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
